message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying paper and this repository."
type: software
title: "The Query Complexity of Envy-Free Division: Lean Proofs and Supporting Materials"
authors:
  - family-names: Farhadi
    given-names: Alireza
    affiliation: Profound
  - family-names: Hajiaghayi
    given-names: Mohammadtaghi
    affiliation: University of Maryland, College Park
repository-code: "https://github.com/farhadi94/envy-free-division"
url: "https://github.com/farhadi94/envy-free-division"
abstract: >-
  Lean formalizations of four main query-complexity results for envy-free
  division: deterministic exact chores, randomized exact cake and chores,
  a randomized quadratic exact lower bound, and mixed-resource impossibility
  for prescribed leftmost-root and rightmost-root oracles. The repository
  includes explicit model and endpoint manifests, pinned dependencies,
  axiom-audit scripts, scoped correspondence reviews, and exact-arithmetic
  finite checks. Conservative formal upper-bound variants preserve the main
  bounds without claiming every sharper auxiliary ledger verbatim. The
  manuscript is maintained separately. Recorded source hashes and build
  status identify the verified revision; internal reviews are not human
  peer review.
